  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin market cap fell 2.3% over 30D:</strong> Stablecoin market cap at $288.30B (2.3% lower over 30D) points to contracting crypto dollar liquidity\u2014often a tighter tape for market-making, DeFi collateral, and risk appetite. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/10/26/occ-calls-on-community-banks-to-enter-the-stablecoin-payments-market\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OCC calls on community banks to enter the stablecoin payments market</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/10/26/canada-opens-consultation-on-draft-stablecoin-rules-maintains-ban-on-yields\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Canada opens consultation on draft stablecoin rules, maintains ban on yields</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Bank rails are pushing stablecoins into treasury workflows:</strong> That pushes demand toward treasury and settlement use cases, not only exchange trading liquidity. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-wins-final-us-approval-for-national-trust-bank?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ripple wins final US approval for national trust bank</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
